# reibun currently runs as a static React/Vite application.
# No runtime secret is required for the current app.
#
# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets serves the built ./dist directory.
# If you add Vite environment variables later, remember that VITE_* values
# are bundled into client-side JavaScript and are visible to users.
# Never place API keys or other secrets in client-exposed Vite variables.
